## Overview
Implements a handwritten digit classification system using a Random Forest classifier on the classic MNIST-like dataset. Includes preprocessing, model training, and evaluation with confusion matrix visualisation.

## Features
• 🖼️ Image loading and flattening
• 📊 Random Forest classifier
• 📈 Confusion matrix and accuracy metrics
• 📦 Simple requirements file (numpy, scikit-learn, matplotlib)

## How to Run
```bash
cd 26-Machine-Learning-HandwrittenRecognition
pip install -r requirements.txt
python CodeAlpha_HandwrittenRecognition.py
```
